      "sourcePath": "source/index.mdx",
      "body": "---\ntitle: Frozen Showcase\ndescription: A frozen artifact set that exercises every documented MDX component.\nkeywords: [\"overview\", \"showcase\", \"compatibility\"]\nicon: book\n---\n\nFrozen Showcase is a fixture site. It exists so the evergreen renderer proves it can still read artifact schema version 1.\n\n<CardGrid>\n  <Card\n    subtitle=\"Start\"\n    title=\"Quickstart\"\n    description=\"Install dependencies and run the docs site locally.\"\n    href=\"/quickstart\"\n  />\n  <Card\n    title=\"Components\"\n    href=\"/components\"\n    icon=\"alignJustify\"\n    variant=\"small\"\n    description=\"Notes, steps, and tabs.\"\n  />\n  <Card\n    title=\"Repository\"\n    href=\"https://github.com/doxahq/doxa\"\n    external={true}\n  />\n</CardGrid>\n\n## What this site covers\n\n- Grouped navigation with icons and badges.\n- Two sections: documentation and API reference.\n- Every component from the component playbook.\n\n<Note title=\"Frozen\">\n  Do not edit the pages of this site. A change here silently weakens the compatibility gate.\n</Note>\n",
